		},
		{
			"id":"e18d0d6139051547",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"- PRODUCTION GAP\n- REASONING BARRIER\n- INTEGRATION MAZE",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1560,
			"y":4120,
			"width":440,
			"height":140
		},
		{
			"id":"f80cdef8c945383c",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Dear ....\n\nAs per the discussion between my team and you during the past few weeks, we are in the middle of developing multiple applications, including an artificial enhanced financial analysis platform. \n\nI would need you to prioritize the collaboration, informing about data sources for our financial analysis platform. The lacking necessary data sources comprising of costing, consumption, and overhead allocation data is preventing my team from keeping up with the direct and urgent requirements from me, affecting our major projects for Quarter 3/4.Analyze all reliable APIs and official sources providing USD/VND data. Distinguish ICE market rates, TradingView data, SBV central rates and Vietnamese bank retail rates. Compare latency, OHLC history, bid/ask availability, API access, licensing, cost and production suitability. Recommend an architecture for both a TradingView Pine Script indicator and an external AMSTE macro-data backend, with copy-ready Pine Script and PowerShell examplesAnalyze all reliable APIs and official sources providing USD/VND data. Distinguish ICE market rates, TradingView data, SBV central rates and Vietnamese bank retail rates. Compare latency, OHLC history, bid/ask availability, API access, licensing, cost and production suitability. Recommend an architecture for both a TradingView Pine Script indicator and an external AMSTE macro-data backend, with copy-ready Pine Script and PowerShell examples\n\nI hope that you guys will focus on this once you receive my emails.\n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-930,
			"y":5400,
			"width":540,
			"height":480,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"832d4d998d4ba960",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Dear Varun, \n\nThank you, for your understanding, i dearly hope that my IT R&D team will receive the resources needed to fulfill any requests from me and the BOD.\n\nNo need to further address this urgency, yet i would love to have the data sources detailed as soon as possible. \n\nMuch appreciated for your collaboration efforts, and for ensuring the readiness of our master and transactional data from our ERP. \n\n ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-520,
			"y":6200,
			"width":600,
			"height":320
		},
		{
			"id":"acf1ab7d303098eb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"6.8.2026\n- ~~follow up GDI API~~\n[- *follow up on FIn.AI rules based engine]()*\n- ~~consults for sew-wash~~\n- ~~checkup on sourcing~~ \n- upadte report on allocation\n- - **craft report for gemini ent**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
